#### What does this implement/fix?
This PR deletes the following redundant linear filter implementations: `*_IIR_forback1`, `*_IIR_forback1` and replace them to calls to `lfilter`/`sosfilt` in order to have a single filter implementation. As a result, several C functions will be removed.

